> files, so could I just copy/paste the data to merge them? Would I need
> to sort the data at all if I did that? Why are there two files (record
> and logfile)? Is there connected data stored anywhere else?

The record file is sorted by descending score, so unless the lowest score
of one file is higher than the highest one of the other file, just simply
appending one file to another leaves them in a wrong order.
Also, normally the record file only contains three entries for any single
playername / character class combination.

Entries for all the games played are appended to the end of the logfile,
and record is the highscore list that contains the best games, up to 100
entries, up to 3 of any player/class combo.

